alse,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-03-31T14:36:33Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T00:03:24Z","closed_at":"2025-04-01T00:03:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104844","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104844","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104844.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104844.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-01T00:03:13Z"},"body":"Follow-up of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103708.\r\n\r\n`cast_to` currently uses a fallback to `dynamic_cast` for `Object` subclasses that do not use `GDCLASS`. This is unnecessary, because the simple method works for them all the same; they just need some more boilerplate. This PR adds that boilerplate.\r\n\r\nThis is equivalent to the solution of @lawnjelly's https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104825 for 3.x.\r\n\r\n## Explanation\r\nThe only reason we needed to use a `dynamic_cast` fallback in `cast_to` was that some classes did not override `_derives_from`. \r\nWe can make a \"simpler\" `GDCLASS` - like macro, that only adds the functionality for casting (other functionality may be transferred later?). It is not a hard requirement (yet?); it's only needed when using `cast_to` with the type, which is a statically asserted assumption.\r\n\r\n`cast_to` with the custom implementation is faster than `dynamic_cast`, so this will speed up casting for affected types.\r\n\r\n## `_derives_from`\r\nI have removed `_derives_from` in favour of the existing `is_class_ptr`. The reason is that `typeid` still compiles to unnecessarily complicated code ([ref](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103708#issuecomment-2708817587)), and thus the simple reference check should be faster.\r\nThis also decreases the size of `Object` types by 8 bytes again (through the removed `vtable` entry).\r\n\r\n## Other fixes\r\nSome of the changed files did not want to compile due to warnings treated as errors, such as:\r\n```c++\r\nmodules/mbedtls/crypto_mbedtls.h:57:16: warning: 'save' overrides a member function but is not marked 'override' [-Winconsistent-missing-override]\r\n   57 |         virtual Error save(const String &p_path, bool p_public_only);\r\n      |                       ^\r\n./core/crypto/crypto.h:49:16: note: overridden virtual function is here\r\n   49 |         virtual Error save(const String &p_path, bool p_public_only = false) = 0;\r\n      |                       ^\r\n```\r\n\r\nSo i needed to fix those along the way.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104844/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104844/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}